            "review_title": "Review at Hoang TY 1",
            "review_text": "Ian S\nSydney, Australia112 contributions\n0\nFirst meal in Vietnam\nNov 2015 • Family\nThe six of us had a meal here after our flight from Sydney. We chose it because it had some great reviews and was close to our hotel.\nWe were not disappointed. We had two vegetarians in our group and we were worried about choosing dishes for them from the menu. This was slightly complicated by language difficulties and we eventually had about six of the staff helping us somewhat to their and our amusement.\nWe need not have worried as all meals seem to come with a mountain of greens and in the end it was the meat eaters who may have felt to be missing out.\nGreat food friendly atmosphere and very inexpensive. Total cost for the six of us including beer was $43.00 Aud\nRead more\nWritten November 22, 2015",
